    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it wasn't something that happened \"to\" me. i was a bystander. i saw a kid getting bullied every single day for months and i just... i just went to class. i stayed quiet. i didn't want any trouble. now i look back and i just see a coward. it feels like i'm just a hollow person pretending to be human. how can anyone actually believe i'm a good person when i know what i am?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
